0003/** :author tda
0004/* TODO Enter your code here
0005DEFINE DATA LOCAL
00061 CRUISERECORD (A500)
00071    CRUISE-ID (A5)
00081    CRUISE-STATUS (A5)
00091    CRUISE-START (A15)
00101 REDEFINE CRUISE-START
0011  2 YEAR  (N4)
0012  2 MONTH (N2)
0013  2 DAY   (N2) 
00141    CRUISE-END (A15)
00151 REDEFINE CRUISE-END
0016  2 END-YEAR (N4)
0017  2 END-MONTH (N2)
0018  2 END-DAY (N2)
00191    START-HARBOUR (A50)
00201 EXTRA (A50)
00211    DESTINATION-HARBOUR (A20)
00221    YACHT-ID (A5)
00231 #POS (N5) INIT <5>
00241 START-TIME (A5)
00251 END-TIME (A5)
0026END-DEFINE
0027*
0028DEFINE WORK FILE 1
0029  'C:\TRAINING\new-cruises.TXT'
0030DEFINE WORK FILE 2
0031  'C:\TRAINING\FINAL-CRUISE.TXT'
0032*
0033READ WORK 1 CRUISERECORD
0034  SEPARATE CRUISERECORD INTO
0035    CRUISE-ID
0036    CRUISE-STATUS
0037    CRUISE-START
0038    CRUISE-END
0039    START-HARBOUR
0040    DESTINATION-HARBOUR
0041    YACHT-ID
0042    WITH DELIMITER '#'
0043* 1.In some records you will see there is a comment between brackets. Remove this comment with bracket and all.
0044  SEPARATE START-HARBOUR INTO
0045    START-HARBOUR
0046    EXTRA
0047  IGNORE WITH DELIMITER '('
0048* 2. The start and end dates contain a date and a time. Split the date and the time so that you have start-date and a start-time and an end-date and an end-time for each record.
0049  SEPARATE CRUISE-START INTO
0050    CRUISE-START
0051    START-TIME
0052    WITH DELIMITER '-'
0053*
0054  SEPARATE CRUISE-END INTO
0055    CRUISE-END
0056    END-TIME
0057    WITH DELIMITER '-'
0058* 3.The dates in this file have all already expired. Please add 3 year and 6 months to each date. Be aware that the date must be a valid date.
0059  ADD 3 TO YEAR
0060  ADD 6 TO MONTH
0061*
0062  IF MONTH GT 12
0063    ADD 1 TO YEAR
0064    SUBTRACT 12 FROM MONTH 
0065  END-IF
0066* 
0067  ADD 3 TO END-YEAR
0068  ADD 6 TO END-MONTH
0069*
0070  IF END-MONTH GT 12
0071    ADD 1 TO END-YEAR
0072    SUBTRACT 12 FROM END-MONTH 
0073  END-IF
0074*
0075  WRITE WORK 2
0076    CRUISE-ID
0077    CRUISE-STATUS
0078    CRUISE-START
0079    START-TIME
0080    CRUISE-END
0081    END-TIME
0082    START-HARBOUR
0083    DESTINATION-HARBOUR
0084    YACHT-ID
0085END-WORK
0086END
